# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:437
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_2723daa6:

    # NYX @ talk "They were let in because their paperwork checked out, but an officer flagged it as suspicious."
    NYX @ talk "그들의 서류가 정상이어서 들여보내줬지만, 한 장교가 수상하다고 표시했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:438
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_71e6f91f:

    # NYX @ think "When I looked closer, I realized the paperwork was a forgery."
    NYX @ think "그들에게 그게 너라고 생각한다고 말했더니, 그들이 너희 둘을 식별하라고 나를 데려왔어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:439
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_f0bc0383:

    # NYX @ think "I sent my men, including Sergeant Poltrik, to track the traders, but none of them returned."
    NYX @ think "폴트릭 하사를 포함한 내 부하들을 상인들을 추적하도록 보냈지만, 아무도 돌아오지 않았어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:443
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_9f812a8b:

    # NYX @ shock "That depends... Is the risk of a plague spreading through Novaras {i}during a siege{/i} worth ignoring?"
    NYX @ shock "그건 경우에 따라 달라… {i}공성 중에{/i} 역병이 노바라스에 퍼질 위험을 무시할 가치가 있을까?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:444
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_8e053423:

    # NYX @ shock "Or what if it's not disease, but explosives? Or something worse?"
    NYX @ shock "아니면 질병이 아니라 폭발물이라면? 아니면 더 나쁜 거라면?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:445
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_2357fc10:

    # NYX @ angry "Even if it's just smuggled contraband, I can't let gangs use this crisis to their advantage."
    NYX @ angry "단순한 밀수품일지라도, 갱단이 이 위기를 이용하게 둘 순 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:449
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_5459bbf0:

    # NYX @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Without proof, I can't pull guards from the wall."
    NYX @ sad "{i}*한숨*{/i} 증거 없이는 성벽에서 경비병을 뺄 수가 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:450
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_8f3ff736:

    # NYX @ sad "Let's pray your {i}'source'{/i} is wrong."
    NYX @ sad "네 {i}'정보원'{/i}이 틀렸길 기도하자."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:451
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_55d14314:

    # MC @ talk "Where were your men last seen?"
    MC @ talk "마르쿠스는 어딨어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:452
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_069b1991:

    # NYX @ talk "Sergeant Poltrik and his men were last seen questioning the gate guards."
    NYX @ talk "폴트릭 병장과 그의 부하들은 마지막으로 성문 경비병들에게 질문하는 모습이 목격되었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:453
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talktonyx_firsttime_menu2_5aeb82a7:

    # NYX @ think "I'd start there if I were you."
    NYX @ think "나라면 거기서부터 시작할 거야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:461
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_68dfb6cd:

    # GUARD "Ahh... Yes."
    GUARD  "아아... 그래."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:462
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_c3a8ad4c:

    # GUARD "We told the sergeant all we could about those strange traders."
    GUARD "우리는 그 이상한 상인들에 대해 할 수 있는 만큼 병장에게 다 말했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:463
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_44c733cc:

    # GUARD "What do you want to know?"
    GUARD "뭘 알고 싶은데?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:467
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_24feb35d:

    # GUARD "They were... strange."
    GUARD "그들은… 이상했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:468
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_73831362:

    # GUARD "Pale as ghosts, and reeked of something foul."
    GUARD "유령처럼 창백하고, 역겨운 냄새를 풍겼다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:469
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_eabeb70b:

    # GUARD "Said they had come down from Angmurus, talking about a bad season and needing to restock before restarting their trade."
    GUARD "앙무루스에서 내려왔다고 하더군, 계절이 안 좋아서 다시 장사를 시작하기 전에 재고를 채워야 한다고."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:470
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_3a68a411:

    # GUARD "We almost didn't let them in."
    GUARD "우린 거의 그들을 들이지 않을 뻔했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:471
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_d23bdcc7:

    # GUARD "But with all the paperwork in order… what were we supposed to do?"
    GUARD "하지만 서류가 완벽했는데… 우리가 뭘 할 수 있었겠어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:472
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu1_db79adb4:

    # GUARD "Our kingdoms may be divided, but free trade is still honored."
    GUARD "우리 왕국들은 나뉘어 있지만, 자유 무역은 여전히 존중된다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:475
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_05e0f9f0:

    # GUARD "Of course not!"
    GUARD "당연히 아니지!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:476
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_4e3036d0:

    # GUARD "If we had, we'd have told them to sling their hook!"
    GUARD "알았더라면, 당장 꺼지라고 했을 거야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:477
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_9eeb4641:

    # GUARD "The paperwork was flawless—even had the correct wax seal."
    GUARD "서류는 완벽했어—봉인 밀랍 인장조차도 정확했지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:481
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_46cf89a1:

    # GUARD "Like they hadn't washed in months."
    GUARD "몇 달 동안 씻지 않은 것처럼."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:482
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_77abbcc7:

    # GUARD "For a moment, I thought they were undead…"
    GUARD "잠시, 나는 그들이 언데드인 줄 알았다…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:483
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_273da914:

    # GUARD "But no, they were alive alright."
    GUARD "하지만 아니, 그들은 분명히 살아 있었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:484
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_20d4a46d:

    # GUARD "Figured they were just deep Northerners. I hear people in Angmurus can go months without washing."
    GUARD "그냥 완전 북부인인가 보다 했지. 앙무루스 사람들은 몇 달씩 안 씻는다고 들었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:488
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_830a7f6d:

    # GUARD "Ask away then..."
    GUARD "그럼 물어봐…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:492
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_a01b11d8:

    # GUARD "Food, mostly. But a lot of it was already rotting."
    GUARD "주로 음식이었어. 하지만 상당수는 이미 썩고 있었지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:493
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_49d6742e:

    # GUARD "They claimed it was a bad season and wanted to restock in Novaras before heading back out."
    GUARD "그들은 계절이 안 좋다고 주장하며 다시 떠나기 전에 노바라스에서 재고를 보충하고 싶어 했어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:494
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu2_8cb7282b:

    # GUARD "Strange, but at the time, it didn't seem worth turning them away."
    GUARD "이상했지만, 그때는 그들을 돌려보낼 가치가 없는 것 같았어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:497
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_7af57f03:

    # GUARD "They had personal blades… but that's nothing unusual."
    GUARD "그들은 개인 검을 가지고 있었어… 하지만 그건 특이한 일이 아니야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:498
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_a31d0a72:

    # GUARD "No weapons in their cargo."
    GUARD "그들의 화물에 무기는 없었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:502
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_da3c2429:

    # GUARD "None that I saw."
    GUARD "내가 본 바로는 없어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:506
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_d26a5898:

    # GUARD "They wanted to use it for compost, said they might be able to make some money back that way."
    GUARD "그들은 퇴비로 쓰고 싶어 했어, 그렇게 해서 돈을 좀 회수할 수 있을 거라고 하더군."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:507
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_7384b803:

    # GUARD "Seemed reasonable enough at the time."
    GUARD "그때는 충분히 타당해 보였어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:511
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_830a7f6d:

    # GUARD "Ask away then..."
    GUARD "그럼 물어봐…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:515
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_998a7cf7:

    # GUARD "Last I heard, Sergeant Poltrik and his team were heading toward {i}The Iron Unicorn.{/i}"
    GUARD "내가 마지막으로 들은 바로는, 폴트릭 병장과 그의 팀이 {i}아이언 유니콘{/i} 쪽으로 향하고 있었어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:516
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_69e2de0c:

    # GUARD "Maybe they thought the traders went there?"
    GUARD "어쩌면 그들이 상인들이 거기 갔다고 생각했나?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:518
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_ab03a470:

    # MC @ talk "I see. Thank you for your help."
    MC @ talk "알겠어요. 도와줘서 고마워요."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:519
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_talk_to_guards_about_poltrik_menu3_a9fbea95:

    # MC "(Looks like my next stop is The Iron Unicorn...)"
    MC "(다음 행선지는 아이언 유니콘인 모양이군…)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:528
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_491824eb:

    # "As I stepped into The Iron Unicorn, the atmosphere was tense. The windows were being boarded up, chairs overturned, and tables stacked against the window frames."
    "아이언 유니콘에 발을 들이자, 분위기는 긴장되어 있었다. 창문은 판자로 막혀 있었고, 의자들은 뒤집혀 있었으며, 테이블들은 창틀에 쌓여 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:529
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_ba474f78:

    # "The tavern, once bustling with life, now felt like a barricaded fortress."
    "한때 활기로 북적이던 선술집은 이제 바리케이드로 막힌 요새처럼 느껴졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:531
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_726791a6:

    # SHAY @ what "Sorry, boys. Service is closed until it's safe."
    SHAY @ what "미안, 아가씨들. 안전해질 때까지 영업 중단이야."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:534
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_3afc8172:

    # SHAY @ what "Hm?"
    SHAY @ what "흠?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:535
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_2fa37f8e:

    # SHAY @ shock "Yes, actually!"
    SHAY @ shock "네, 사실이야!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:536
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_64173c73:

    # SHAY @ shock "Now that I think about it, I DO remember some guards asking strange questions."
    SHAY @ shock "생각해보니, 경비병들이 이상한 질문을 하던 게 기억나긴 해."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:538
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_6e7cd6a5:

    # MC @ talk "What did they want to know?"
    MC @ talk "방금 뭐라고 했어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:539
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_3784ae7d:

    # SHAY @ talk "They were asking about some traders—deathly looking fellows who wanted a room for the night."
    SHAY @ talk "어떤 상인들에 대해 묻고 있었어—죽음처럼 창백한 녀석들이었는데 하룻밤 묵을 방을 원했지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:540
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_5c279766:

    # MC @ think "Did you give it to them?"
    MC @ think "그들에게 줬어?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:541
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_26938609:

    # SHAY @ talk "Well, they paid upfront in coin, so I did."
    SHAY @ talk "뭐, 선금을 현금으로 줬으니까, 그렇게 했지."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:542
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_e689ccfd:

    # SHAY @ what "Funny bunch though... Didn't hear a peep from them all night, and by morning, they were gone."
    SHAY @ what "재미있는 무리였지... 밤새 쥐 죽은 듯 조용하더니 아침이 되니 사라졌어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:543
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu1_f511c333:

    # SHAY @ shock "Didn't even stay for breakfast!"
    SHAY @ shock "아침도 안 먹고 갔어!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:546
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_66870631:

    # SHAY @ talk "Like I said, I didn't hear from them after they checked in..."
    SHAY @ talk "말했듯이, 그들이 체크인한 후로는 소식이 없었어..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:547
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_b299b616:

    # SHAY @ what "When I woke up, their room was empty."
    SHAY @ what "그가 내가 다가오는 것을 보았을 때, 그는 바라보며 작게 고개를 끄덕였다."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:551
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_496ee08e:

    # SHAY @ what "Mmm... Not really."
    SHAY @ what "으음... 별로."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:552
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_17ad0bb8:

    # SHAY @ what "If I were you, though, traders like those... They looked like the type to hang around in {i}less reputable places.{/i}"
    SHAY @ what "하지만 내가 너라면, 그런 상인들은... {i}평판이 덜 좋은 곳{/i}에서 어울리는 타입으로 보였어."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:553
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_999a6a87:

    # SHAY @ what "Sorry I can't be more help."
    SHAY @ what "더 도와주지 못해 미안."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TheComingStorm/scr_TheComingStorm_aio.rpy:555
translate kr qst_thecomingstorm_route1_visit_iron_unicorn_menu2_d358ad17:

    # MC "(Damn... Another dead end.)"
